1:1 COMMENT "# astdemo.z -- exercises the public `tokenize` + `ast` preview API: lex a source"
1:81 EOL "\n"
2:1 COMMENT "# string into its full token stream, then parse it to a tree whose one unit"
2:76 EOL "\n"
3:1 COMMENT "# wraps the source."
3:20 EOL "\n"
